    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Wolfgang",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116843270238413958510/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU0qqRkUv74f3tiq0X6CZRTvIAbyXSU00U6-KdVx8px_4QNiY6CAQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "What an awesome team. Super friendly, knowledgeable, and willing to take their time to help you find exactly what you need for your furry friend. They helped me get the best food for Bailey's needs and gave me advice on how to control her allergies with natural supplements. They have a great selection and a fantastic team. We will be back!",
        "time": 1763835334,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "William D'Alesio",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110931930372629604269/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLmodkLuc2m9nbFAGe_5HdXOZx0DxXzx7OVqbcvDMwlCrllQQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I had an amazing experience at this pet store! They offer an intolerance test for pets, so I had both of my cats tested to get to the bottom of their ongoing symptoms. The staff spent HOURS with me going through the results, explaining everything in a way that was easy to understand, and helping me choose the right foods based on each cat’s specific intolerances.\n\nThe improvement has been incredible, my cats now have far fewer symptoms and are finally comfortable again. I also ended up spending about half of what I would have at the vet, and the store had an excellent selection of food options that matched the test results perfectly.\n\nThe store itself is spotless, well-organized, and welcoming. Everyone was friendly, knowledgeable, and genuinely caring. Huge thank you to Marc and Ali, the owners, for going above and beyond to help me and my cats.\n\nHighly recommend this place for their outstanding friendliness and the incredibly helpful intolerance tests!",
        "time": 1763867238,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dana McVittie",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114319329888796108427/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVeiCgpj8jazlGozDLM_F3MhGcLCCq6aafqa5u8PxOmMJZW5-I=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Best store ever! The owners are fantastic and always greet you with a smile. The staff is attentive and helpful. Heavy items are always carried to the car for you. Love the personalized service. My go to for all of my animals needs. Congratulations on such a well run establishment.",
        "time": 1761752224,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jenia Schukov",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110249606275302686616/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjViyyThExWJ6_pSbLZCHrrxlBeDZYd8QtJBbpbDlnu-gMLnHzqI=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "I can’t say enough good things about the staff at Chico! We’ve been coming here for a year now with our pup and they’ve helped us immensely navigating through a few health issues, food changes etc. They’re extremely knowledgable and so friendly and really take the time to help you make the best choices for your pet. We love bringing our pup by the store too!",
        "time": 1755026729,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jessica Menard",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109673878427168667374/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKxr6LB1LQkUa1kEXywGpVc6trHnzg5rHTVZi4JSxkWKydsFg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The owners, the staff and everyone we have encountered at Chico Ile Perrot have been amazing. They love and care for my dog as if he were their own… now he does think he owns the place but I mean 🤷🏼‍♀️ Ravioli loves you guys",
        "time": 1735062837,
